@startuml US_3_1_4_C3_Impl
title US 3.1.4 - Implementação de feedback

component ToastSvc as "ToastService\nBehaviorSubject toasts$"
component ToastUI as "ToastContainerComponent\nHTML overlay"
component Form as "Form Component\n(ex.: DocksComponent)"
component Http as "Service (fetch)"

Form --> Http : POST/PUT/DELETE
Http --> Form : result or error
Form --> ToastSvc : success/error/info
ToastSvc --> ToastUI : stream toasts$
Form --> Form : set loading; mark invalid inputs

@enduml
